{'symbol': 'AVB', 'date': '2021-12-08 16:15:00', 'title': "AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. RECOGNIZED AS A CLIMATE LEADER BY CDP WITH ‘A' SCORE FOR CLIMATE CHANGE", 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. (NYSE: AVB) — AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES INC. [NYSE: AVB] HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR LEADERSHIP IN CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY BY GLOBAL ENVIRONMENTAL NON-PROFIT CDP, SECURING A PLACE ON ITS PRESTIGIOUS ‘A LIST' FOR TACKLING CLIMATE CHANGE. THE COMPANY WAS ACKNOWLEDGED FOR ITS ACTIONS TO CUT EMISSIONS, MITIGATE CLIMATE RISKS, AND DEVELOP THE LOW-CARBON ECONOMY, BASED ON THE DATA REPORTED BY THE COMPANY THROUGH CDP'S 2021 CLIMATE CHANGE QUESTIONN"}